{"id":"d48429d76b7862cc","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-tait-calculus.md","title":"Tait Calculus","display":"df-tait-calculus — Tait Calculus","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-tait-calculus","aliases":["72-df-tait-calculus"],"display":"df-tait-calculus — Tait Calculus","depends_on":["[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","[[72-df-sequent-rule]]","[[72-df-proof-tree]]","[[72-df-gentzen-system]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §1.2.14 print16–18/PDF28–30; Ch.III §3.1 print164–166/PDF176–178; explicit finitary first-order extension","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-tait-calculus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-tait-calculus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tait-calculus — Tait Calculus"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §1.2.14 print16–18/PDF28–30; Ch.III §3.1 print164–166/PDF176–178; explicit finitary first-order extension"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>同一五分量签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 是原子集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NNF}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{NNF}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是下式生成的否定正规形公式集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal Q_T\">\\(\\mathcal Q_T\\)</span> 是有限集合的一侧相继式载体。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal Q_T\">\\(\\mathcal Q_T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NNF}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{NNF}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 遍历原子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in V\">\\(x,y\\in V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；集合构造中这些范围全部有效。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top,\\bot\">\\(\\top,\\bot\\)</span> 也属于NNF；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^\\perp\">\\(A^\\perp\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_+(A),n_-(A)\">\\(n_+(A),n_-(A)\\)</span> 按有限公式树递归。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_\\epsilon\">\\(n_\\epsilon\\)</span> 定义在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma\">\\(X_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}\">\\(\\epsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}\\)</span>。自由代入、FV取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\Gamma)=\\bigcup_{A\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(\\Gamma)=\\bigcup_{A\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{tag}_R\">\\(\\mathsf{tag}_R\\)</span> 为各规则的互异标签。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nT_0&amp;:=\\{P,\\neg P:P\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\}\\cup\\{\\top,\\bot\\},\\\\\nT_{k+1}&amp;:=T_k\\cup\\{A\\land B,A\\lor B:A,B\\in T_k\\}\\cup\\{\\forall xA,\\exists xA:A\\in T_k,x\\in V\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{NNF}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}T_k,\\quad\\mathcal Q_T:=\\{\\Gamma\\subseteq\\operatorname{NNF}_\\Sigma:|\\Gamma|\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\nP^\\perp&amp;:=\\neg P,\\quad(\\neg P)^\\perp:=P,\\quad\\top^\\perp:=\\bot,\\quad\\bot^\\perp:=\\top,\\\\\n(A\\land B)^\\perp&amp;:=A^\\perp\\lor B^\\perp,\\quad(A\\lor B)^\\perp:=A^\\perp\\land B^\\perp,\\\\\n(\\forall xA)^\\perp&amp;:=\\exists xA^\\perp,\\quad(\\exists xA)^\\perp:=\\forall xA^\\perp.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nT_0&amp;:=\\{P,\\neg P:P\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\}\\cup\\{\\top,\\bot\\},\\\\\nT_{k+1}&amp;:=T_k\\cup\\{A\\land B,A\\lor B:A,B\\in T_k\\}\\cup\\{\\forall xA,\\exists xA:A\\in T_k,x\\in V\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{NNF}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}T_k,\\quad\\mathcal Q_T:=\\{\\Gamma\\subseteq\\operatorname{NNF}_\\Sigma:|\\Gamma|\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\nP^\\perp&amp;:=\\neg P,\\quad(\\neg P)^\\perp:=P,\\quad\\top^\\perp:=\\bot,\\quad\\bot^\\perp:=\\top,\\\\\n(A\\land B)^\\perp&amp;:=A^\\perp\\lor B^\\perp,\\quad(A\\lor B)^\\perp:=A^\\perp\\land B^\\perp,\\\\\n(\\forall xA)^\\perp&amp;:=\\exists xA^\\perp,\\quad(\\exists xA)^\\perp:=\\forall xA^\\perp.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ax}_T&amp;:=\\{\\Gamma\\cup\\{P,\\neg P\\}:\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal Q_T,P\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\}\\cup\\{\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\top\\}:\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal Q_T\\},\\\\\nR_\\lor&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{C\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\lor B\\}\\rangle:C\\in\\{A,B\\}\\},\\\\\nR_\\land&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},\\Gamma\\cup\\{B\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\land B\\}\\rangle\\},\\\\\nR_\\exists&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A[t/x]\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\exists xA\\}\\rangle:\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\},\\\\\nR_\\forall&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A[y/x]\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\forall xA\\}\\rangle:\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(y,x,A)\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\Gamma)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(\\forall xA)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf T_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\langle\\mathcal Q_T,\\mathsf{Ax}_T,\\bigcup_{R\\in\\{R_\\lor,R_\\land,R_\\exists,R_\\forall\\}}\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{tag}_R}(R)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_T&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathsf{cut},A,\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},\\Delta\\cup\\{A^\\perp\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\Delta\\rangle:\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal Q_T,A\\in\\operatorname{NNF}_\\Sigma\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ax}_T&amp;:=\\{\\Gamma\\cup\\{P,\\neg P\\}:\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal Q_T,P\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\}\\cup\\{\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\top\\}:\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal Q_T\\},\\\\\nR_\\lor&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{C\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\lor B\\}\\rangle:C\\in\\{A,B\\}\\},\\\\\nR_\\land&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},\\Gamma\\cup\\{B\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\land B\\}\\rangle\\},\\\\\nR_\\exists&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A[t/x]\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\exists xA\\}\\rangle:\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\},\\\\\nR_\\forall&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A[y/x]\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\forall xA\\}\\rangle:\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(y,x,A)\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\Gamma)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(\\forall xA)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf T_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\langle\\mathcal Q_T,\\mathsf{Ax}_T,\\bigcup_{R\\in\\{R_\\lor,R_\\land,R_\\exists,R_\\forall\\}}\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{tag}_R}(R)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_T&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathsf{cut},A,\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},\\Delta\\cup\\{A^\\perp\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\Delta\\rangle:\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal Q_T,A\\in\\operatorname{NNF}_\\Sigma\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nn_+(P)&amp;:=P,\\quad n_-(P):=\\neg P,\\quad n_+(\\top):=\\top,\\quad n_-(\\top):=\\bot,\\quad n_+(\\bot):=\\bot,\\quad n_-(\\bot):=\\top,\\\\\nn_+(\\neg A)&amp;:=n_-(A),\\quad n_-(\\neg A):=n_+(A),\\\\\nn_+(A\\land B)&amp;:=n_+(A)\\land n_+(B),\\quad n_-(A\\land B):=n_-(A)\\lor n_-(B),\\\\\nn_+(A\\lor B)&amp;:=n_+(A)\\lor n_+(B),\\quad n_-(A\\lor B):=n_-(A)\\land n_-(B),\\\\\nn_+(A\\to B)&amp;:=n_-(A)\\lor n_+(B),\\quad n_-(A\\to B):=n_+(A)\\land n_-(B),\\\\\nn_+(\\forall xA)&amp;:=\\forall xn_+(A),\\quad n_-(\\forall xA):=\\exists xn_-(A),\\\\\nn_+(\\exists xA)&amp;:=\\exists xn_+(A),\\quad n_-(\\exists xA):=\\forall xn_-(A),\\\\\nb_T(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta)&amp;:=\\{n_-(A):A\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma)\\}\\cup\\{n_+(B):B\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Delta)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nn_+(P)&amp;:=P,\\quad n_-(P):=\\neg P,\\quad n_+(\\top):=\\top,\\quad n_-(\\top):=\\bot,\\quad n_+(\\bot):=\\bot,\\quad n_-(\\bot):=\\top,\\\\\nn_+(\\neg A)&amp;:=n_-(A),\\quad n_-(\\neg A):=n_+(A),\\\\\nn_+(A\\land B)&amp;:=n_+(A)\\land n_+(B),\\quad n_-(A\\land B):=n_-(A)\\lor n_-(B),\\\\\nn_+(A\\lor B)&amp;:=n_+(A)\\lor n_+(B),\\quad n_-(A\\lor B):=n_-(A)\\land n_-(B),\\\\\nn_+(A\\to B)&amp;:=n_-(A)\\lor n_+(B),\\quad n_-(A\\to B):=n_+(A)\\land n_-(B),\\\\\nn_+(\\forall xA)&amp;:=\\forall xn_+(A),\\quad n_-(\\forall xA):=\\exists xn_-(A),\\\\\nn_+(\\exists xA)&amp;:=\\exists xn_+(A),\\quad n_-(\\exists xA):=\\forall xn_-(A),\\\\\nb_T(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta)&amp;:=\\{n_-(A):A\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma)\\}\\cup\\{n_+(B):B\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Delta)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Tait一侧有限集合载体与Seq的有限序列载体分开。b_T明确翻译公式极性并忘却顺序/重复；不把两对象判为字面相同。源书§1.2.14描述命题及无穷合取/析取版本；这里的有限一阶量词版是相应标准扩展，逐项注明自由代入和新鲜性。有限证明用通用DerivationTree且根标签在Q_T，禁止调用Σ专用的二侧ProofTree。</p>\n<p>2026-10-13 来源定位校正：语言及ω算术规则位于第III章印刷164–166/PDF176–178；本节点的通用编码／高度递归／有限一阶扩展仍为已标明的本地构造，并非原书所有参数化规则的逐字编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-rule","status":"resolved","id":"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\top,\\bot$ 也属于NNF；$A^\\perp$、$n_+(A),n_-(A)$ 按有限公式树递归。$n_\\epsilon$ 定义在 $X_\\Sigma$，$\\epsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}$。自由代入、FV取 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]]；$\\operatorname{FV}(\\Gamma)=\\bigcup_{A\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)$。$\\mathsf{tag}_R$ 为各规则的互异标签。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NNF}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal Q_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal Q_T","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NNF}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\top,\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"A^\\perp","display":false},{"tex":"n_+(A),n_-(A)","display":false},{"tex":"n_\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"X_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\Gamma)=\\bigcup_{A\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{tag}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nT_0&:=\\{P,\\neg P:P\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\}\\cup\\{\\top,\\bot\\},\\\\\nT_{k+1}&:=T_k\\cup\\{A\\land B,A\\lor B:A,B\\in T_k\\}\\cup\\{\\forall xA,\\exists xA:A\\in T_k,x\\in V\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{NNF}_\\Sigma&:=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}T_k,\\quad\\mathcal Q_T:=\\{\\Gamma\\subseteq\\operatorname{NNF}_\\Sigma:|\\Gamma|\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\nP^\\perp&:=\\neg P,\\quad(\\neg P)^\\perp:=P,\\quad\\top^\\perp:=\\bot,\\quad\\bot^\\perp:=\\top,\\\\\n(A\\land B)^\\perp&:=A^\\perp\\lor B^\\perp,\\quad(A\\lor B)^\\perp:=A^\\perp\\land B^\\perp,\\\\\n(\\forall xA)^\\perp&:=\\exists xA^\\perp,\\quad(\\exists xA)^\\perp:=\\forall xA^\\perp.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ax}_T&:=\\{\\Gamma\\cup\\{P,\\neg P\\}:\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal Q_T,P\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\}\\cup\\{\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\top\\}:\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal Q_T\\},\\\\\nR_\\lor&:=\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{C\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\lor B\\}\\rangle:C\\in\\{A,B\\}\\},\\\\\nR_\\land&:=\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},\\Gamma\\cup\\{B\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\land B\\}\\rangle\\},\\\\\nR_\\exists&:=\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A[t/x]\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\exists xA\\}\\rangle:\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\},\\\\\nR_\\forall&:=\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A[y/x]\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\forall xA\\}\\rangle:\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(y,x,A)\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\Gamma)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(\\forall xA)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf T_\\Sigma&:=\\langle\\mathcal Q_T,\\mathsf{Ax}_T,\\bigcup_{R\\in\\{R_\\lor,R_\\land,R_\\exists,R_\\forall\\}}\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{tag}_R}(R)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_T&:=\\{\\langle\\mathsf{cut},A,\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},\\Delta\\cup\\{A^\\perp\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\Delta\\rangle:\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal Q_T,A\\in\\operatorname{NNF}_\\Sigma\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nn_+(P)&:=P,\\quad n_-(P):=\\neg P,\\quad n_+(\\top):=\\top,\\quad n_-(\\top):=\\bot,\\quad n_+(\\bot):=\\bot,\\quad n_-(\\bot):=\\top,\\\\\nn_+(\\neg A)&:=n_-(A),\\quad n_-(\\neg A):=n_+(A),\\\\\nn_+(A\\land B)&:=n_+(A)\\land n_+(B),\\quad n_-(A\\land B):=n_-(A)\\lor n_-(B),\\\\\nn_+(A\\lor B)&:=n_+(A)\\lor n_+(B),\\quad n_-(A\\lor B):=n_-(A)\\land n_-(B),\\\\\nn_+(A\\to B)&:=n_-(A)\\lor n_+(B),\\quad n_-(A\\to B):=n_+(A)\\land n_-(B),\\\\\nn_+(\\forall xA)&:=\\forall xn_+(A),\\quad n_-(\\forall xA):=\\exists xn_-(A),\\\\\nn_+(\\exists xA)&:=\\exists xn_+(A),\\quad n_-(\\exists xA):=\\forall xn_-(A),\\\\\nb_T(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta)&:=\\{n_-(A):A\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma)\\}\\cup\\{n_+(B):B\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Delta)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":4467,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-tait-calculus|df-tait-calculus — Tait Calculus]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-tait-calculus|df-tait-calculus — Tait Calculus]]"},{"id":"64b0ea7df35691d2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf T_\\Sigma$、$\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_T$、$\\mathcal Q_T$ 是 [[72-df-tait-calculus]] 的独立一侧有限集合演算；$\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal Q_T$。证明与推导使用 [[72-df-proof-tree]] 的通用接口。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-231","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-tait-calculus|72-df-tait-calculus]]"}],"outgoing":["3c073b947b255638","f9452e4a7788a117","d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","81c9c855e009a6d4","c60a11e47ac58326"]}